OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening in the south, but cloud will
OL,7,Fquickly increase elsewhere, bringing a
OL,8,Ffew spots of light rain. Mostly
OL,9,Fovercast overnight, with further
OL,10,Fpatchy rain possible. Rather mild once
OL,11,Fagain with light winds throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start but some
OL,14,Fbreaks will develop allowing some
OL,15,Fsunshine. Feeling warm and humid with
OL,16,Fa few spots of rain possible, which
OL,17,Fmay turn heavier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
